JPdfBookmarks — authors and maintainers

Original author and project founder
----------------------------------
Flaviano Petrocchi — created JPdfBookmarks; original Subversion tree and
releases on SourceForge (user: fla1257).

Current maintainer (canonical Git line)
---------------------------------------
Flaviano Petrocchi — canonical repository:
https://github.com/fpetrocchi/JPdfBookmarks

Notable upstream lines merged into this tree
--------------------------------------------
- SourceForge Subversion branches/pdfbox (e.g. revision 213) — migration
  toward Apache PDFBox; tarball basis for the Mavenized line described in
  README.adoc (jpdfbookmarks-code-r213-branches-pdfbox).

- life888888 — GitHub fork that Mavenized the project, fixed CJK bookmark
  display in the GUI, packaging and tooling improvements; see THANKS and
  https://github.com/life888888/JPdfBookmarks

For a fuller list of contributors over time, see Git history and past
SourceForge commit logs.
